<title>GERMANY: VW says to raise car prices 1.9 pct.</title>
<headline>VW says to raise car prices 1.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car manufacturer Volkswagen AG said on Friday that it would raise the price on its passenger cars by an average 1.9 percent on April 28.</p>
<p>In a statement, the group said that its new models would all feature a third brake light as an additional safety feature.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
